487 - In the Garden
 / 
Key: Ab
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 487
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[Ab]I come to the garden alone, While the [Db]dew is still on the [Ab]roses;
And the [Eb]voice I hear, falling [Ab]on [Eb]my [Ab]ear, The [Bb7]Son of God dis[Eb]clos[Eb7]es.
And He [Ab]walks with me, And He [Eb7]talks with me, And He [Db]tells me [Eb7]I am His [Ab]own;
And the joy we [C7]share as we [Fm]tar[Eb7]ry[Db]there, None [Ab]other has [Eb7]ever [Ab]known.

